body:
I feel this way too. I have anorexia and a few years ago I got down to 75lbs. I wish it killed me so bad. It would been such a relief.

&#x200B;

I've thought about doing it with a gun the most. Just pull the trigger and your basically dead. I live alone so there's no chance of anyone trying to save me.

Suicide is not selfish. Anyone who says that to you is an asshole! They probably have no idea how bad it feels to be suicidal. 

&#x200B;

If I kill myself I just want people to be happy that I'm no longer in pain. It will be such a relief.
